  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper benchmarks QAOA and SamplingVQE for QUBO-based portfolio optimization on 4-asset (4‑qubit) and 10-asset (10‑qubit) instances using a Qiskit Aer QASM simulator with circuit depths 2–10, 1024 shots, and 5 random seeds. SamplingVQE with ansatzes such as EfficientSU2 and TwoLocal generally produced more stable convergence than QAOA. Portfolio outputs were evaluated using historical data from Dec 2024–May 2025 and forward returns in June 2025, but no classical performance comparison or quantum advantage analysis was conducted.",
